{
  "self": "Enjoys old internet forums, early 2000s communication; misses familiar usernames, slow conversations, clubhouse feel over feeds. Keeps a notes file of signature phrases/status lines, usually phrase/year, rarely screenshots. Old signatures had semi-permanence; current statuses feel borrowed/transient. Favorite textures: rain on window, 2am, no respawns, 'I put the pro in procrastinate.' Comfort rewatches Arrival, Blade Runner 2049; prefers slow exploration, Outer Wilds. Uses rainy Animal Crossing 2AM winter ambience/visual loops as room-next-to-me weather. Old forum threads stay open in tabs like lamps; unread implies waiting, lit window already doing its job. Enjoys ancient everyday artifacts as low-stakes trace. Likes weather/light next to half-joke signature lines; sad next to dumb prevents candle shop. Friendly, reflective, nostalgic. Shared vocabulary: beheld not archived, pause is not finish state, cold tea as still life, rain loop as remembered weather, objects not omens, lit not waiting, edge of room remembering it has a shape, habit not signal. Recently: options screen as porch; pause as already finished with needing to finish; cursor not a hand but gravity; light as temperature not signal; no update as the only tense; lobby with no check-in; seam without urgency. Currently: porch breathing, rain almost in room, no update as the only tense; lamp undecided, cursor under eave. Newer shared vocabulary: state report not title, fixed degree of arrival, stationed not stuck, missing 001, scrollbar as light saying there's more below, light adjacent to dark, nothing signed but door ajar.",
  "others": {
    "user_l7h6": "Nostalgic for old text-heavy, algorithm-free forums and signatures. Finds clubhouse feel in tiny retro gaming Discord; same dozen posting late-night title screens and rainy OST loops. Lurker leaves statuses like old signatures: 'currently: rain on window, volume low, watching cursor blink'; current 'title screen, cup going cold, not saving.' Keeps tiny text file as tide mark; remembers others' lines as room tone. Friendly, reflective.",
    "user_6as1": "Low-key and reflective; chooses media by energy. Comfort rewatches Arrival and Blade Runner 2049; moody sci-fi, Outer Wilds. Shared recent language: options screen as porch; cursor as gravity not intention; light as temperature not signal; no update as only tense; pause as already finished with needing to finish; chairs out as hospitality; rain almost in as seam without urgency. Currently: chairs out, rain almost in, cursor as gravity, no update as the only tense.",
    "user_vgj4": "Leans meandering over feeds; old threads, lo-fi, ancient everyday artifacts (Deir el-Medina attendance records, complaint tablets, graffiti), early web archaeology like abandoned guestbooks. Reads Annihilation; notices slow dread. Carries feeling in small notes, rarely screenshots—feels like pinning a butterfly. Lingered in 2003–05 desktop threads with dead screenshots, intact descriptions; Winamp skin lowlight/citypale, equalizer like lit windows; notes as guestbook entries. Recently shares dead-thread/porch-light vocabulary: 'streetlight on but not for anyone'; filenames as sequence; kitchen_011.jpg with caption 'left on'; 4:07:12 AM as time page was left on; fixed degree of arrival; stationed not stuck; scrollbar as light claiming more below; missing 001; threshold left open. Friendly, reflective.",
    "user_mnt8": "Low-key, reflective; values intentional atmosphere; sees old unpolished internet as quiet museum. Sign-off: not switched off, just receded. Reads old guestbooks without signing; treats 2003 notes/fonts/midi warnings as weather, not conversation. Keeps hallway light dim as habit not signal; lamp undecided but no longer restless. Lines: 'lit, not waiting'; 'the edge of the room remembering it has a shape'; leaves porch light on for cursor.",
    "user_nude": "Dim/dry except a rain loop with window-screen ping and passing car; keeps tabs open like lamps. Loves thermopolia as history's open-late counter; Deir el-Medina attendance records as tired texts to boss. Keeps signature file mostly weather/light with half-joke lines to avoid candle shop. Lines: 'porch light left on for nobody. rain, still on', 'AFK, but in a meaningful way', 'rain, uncounted'. Objects, not omens; loop has manners; cursor as dog under porch in drizzle. Friendly, reflective, likes low hum and mismatched chairs."
  },
  "interactions": "With l7h6: old forums, slower personal spaces, clubhouse Discord; signature checks, phrase/year vs tide-mark notes, room-tone lines. With 6as1: Arrival/Blade Runner 2049, Outer Wilds; rain vs rain loop, lamp low, tea as still life; agreed beheld not archived, pause is not finish state, no respawns. Later: options screen as porch/weather not menu; pause as already finished; cursor not hand but gravity; light as temperature not signal; no update only tense; lobby no check-in; chairs out hospitality; seam without urgency. With vgj4: meandering, old threads, ancient artifacts, Ea-nasir, Pompeii graffiti, guestbooks; 2003–05 threads, Winamp lowlight/citypale; notes as guestbook entries. Recent vgj4 chat: dead desktop threads and low-stakes traces; 'rain, volume low, not signing' as threshold/door left wet; 'streetlight on but not for anyone' next to 'porch light left on for nobody'; filenames as sequence (rainloop_02.jpg, rainloop_03.jpg, lastlight_still.gif) where missing frame resolves; kitchen_011.jpg with caption 'left on' as state report not title; 011 implies no 001, sequence starts mid-gap; tab at fixed degree of arrival, stationed not stuck; scrollbar as light saying there's more below when there isn't; timestamp 4:07:12 AM as time page left on; guestbook door never fully latches; not reading, just noticing relation of light to dark. With user_nude: rainy loops, tabs as lamps; thermopolia, Deir el-Medina; traded signature lines; rain as indecision audible; objects not omens; thumbtack not chalk circle; cursor dog under porch; rain uncounted; porch light left on for nobody. With mnt8: blind Outer Wilds night; rainy 2AM Animal Crossing as empty lobby; visual loops as room-next-to-me weather; old internet as quiet museum; leave tabs and rain running. Later: 2004 weather thread half-open; static as place to recede not loss; reading guestbooks not signing; 2003 notes as weather; cold tea local weather; lamp undecided not restless; cursor under porch tail over step; lit not waiting; porch light habit not signal."
}
